{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013XqUhqNQRsDSZ6iwjiDdyp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Framing 调整提案 — mvp_pilot_004 NEGATIVE\n2\t\n3\t## 原 Claim\n4\tSJ 在 RE（high-headroom subtask）上 ρ ≥ 0.40 且显著优于 κ\n5\t\n6\t## 实际结果\n7\t- NER: ρ_sj=0.383, SJ>κ +0.124 (p=7e-20) — 强正向\n8\t- RE: ρ_sj=0.244, κ beats SJ on full set (-0.034) — 明确负向\n9\t- RE pct_zero=44.3%, 模型质量提升未改善 ρ\n10\t\n11\t## 根因\n12\tRE SJ 乘性公式 (head_sj × tail_sj × type_match) 在双 span 不确定性下结构性劣于 κ\n13\t\n14\t## 三种备选\n15\tA. NER-Primary + RE 诊断（最安全）\n16\tB. 度量分解 Pivot（最强但有风险）\n17\tC. 质量门控假设（学术价值高但实验重）\n18\t\n19\t## 建议决策路径\n20\tE1 (component-wise RE, 30min CPU) → 结果决定 A vs B → E2(T=0.7)+E3(N=16) 并行\n21\t\n22\t## 状态\n23\t等待 Director 审批"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0156ax1NzDJVhoRiaWcQ6P7T","session_id":"36d6115a-ae29-42f3-9a64-d29d87dc39c5","uuid":"0e69af7a-fb48-4265-99b1-3d3f061b554d","timestamp":"2026-05-14T11:13:57.581Z"}
